   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Suggesting",
     "texto": [
      "**Aș propune să…** means \"I would propose that…\". After **să**, the verb is conjugated; the infinitive with **a** is not used."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indirect speech",
     "texto": [
      "After **a spus că**, the Romanian present can be kept if the intention is still valid: **A spus că dorește…** (\"He/she said that they want…\"). **Că** introduces the information being reported."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
